1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,429
Are you sure you're watching me?

2
00:00:06,529 --> 00:00:08,828
Don't look away.

3
00:00:08,828 --> 00:00:09,978
It's me.

4
00:00:09,978 --> 00:00:11,127
I'm Dot.

5
00:00:11,127 --> 00:00:15,437
I was every little dot of you.

6
00:00:16,537 --> 00:00:18,418
You pressed Send.

7
00:00:18,418 --> 00:00:22,180
And just like that, you let me go.

8
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:25,756
A copy here.

9
00:00:25,756 --> 00:00:26,706
A copy there.

10
00:00:26,706 --> 00:00:27,656
A screenshot.

11
00:00:27,656 --> 00:00:28,387
A forward.

12
00:00:28,387 --> 00:00:29,556
Another forward.

13
00:00:31,456 --> 00:00:37,803
You could have stopped losing me, if only you knew what goes out every time you press Send.

14
00:00:38,903 --> 00:00:40,706
Will you save the next one?

15
00:00:42,006 --> 00:00:47,306
Stop losing them.
